    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n5528" root="جرس" body-key="j">
    
      4 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجرس</span></b> : see 1, in six places. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجرس بِالحَلْىِ</span>
(tropical:)  [<i>He made a sound with the ornament</i>]: said of
the owner [or wearer] of the ornament. (A.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3- 
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اجرس الجَرَسَ</span> <i>He struck</i> [or <i>sounded</i>] <i>the bell.</i>
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَجْرَسَنِى السَّبُعُ</span> <i>The animal of prey
heard my sound</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَرْسِى</span>): (ISk, S, A, K:) or
<i>heard it from afar.</i> (TA.)

